Package: libxcomposite-dev
Version: @DEB_LIBXCOMPOSITE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libxcomposite1 (= @DEB_LIBXCOMPOSITE_V@), libx11-dev, libxfixes-dev, x11proto-dev
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Description: X11 Composite extension library (development headers)
 libXcomposite provides an X Window System client interface to the Composite
 extension to the X protocol.
 .
 This package contains the development headers and pkg-config file for the
 library found in libxcomposite1.  Non-developers likely have little use for
 this package.
 .
 More information about X.Org can be found at: <URL:https://www.X.org>
